  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of the expression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math> is ___________."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>replace&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
  }
